  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Study of options to strengthen the scope, functionality, security and financial sustainability of the Integrated Financial Management and Information System (IFMIS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt;Study of the Integrated Financial Management and Information System (IFMIS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt;The specific objectives (SOs) of the assignment are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt; SO1: To strengthen the IT platform for supporting Public Financial Management (PFM) reforms;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt; SO2: To strengthen the automation of public financial management business processes for improved efficiency in service delivery; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: white;&quot;&gt; SO3: To support the generation of standardised accurate and timely financial statements in the Integrated Financial Management System (IFMIS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
